OL,3,ATories pledge to remove #100,000
OL,4,Achildcare 'cliff edge'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives have promised to
OL,7,Fscrap the "absurd cliff edge" that mean
OL,8,Fparents in England lose out on
OL,9,Fchildcare support when they earn more
OL,10,Fthan #100,000 a year.
OL,12,FUnder the current system, only families
OL,13,Fwhere no parent earns more than this
OL,14,Fthreshold are eligible for
OL,15,Fgovernment-funded or tax-free
OL,16,Fchildcare.
OL,18,F"What we want to see is that people who
OL,19,Fwork harder don't get punished for
OL,20,Fdoing so," Conservative leader Kemi
OL,21,FBadenoch told the BBC's Sunday with
OL,22,FLaura Kuenssberg programme.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
