OL,3,ACornell president says university 'must
OL,4,Ado better' after frat house rape
OL,5,Aallegations
OL,6,
OL,7,FCornell University's president says the
OL,8,Fschool "must do better" after a woman
OL,9,Falleged she was drugged and raped by a
OL,10,Fgroup of men at a fraternity house.
OL,12,FIn an eight-minute video statement
OL,13,Freleased on Saturday night, Michael
OL,14,FKotlikoff described the allegations
OL,15,Fraised by the woman, identified as Jane
OL,16,FDoe, as "deeply disturbing".
OL,18,FThe alleged incident has raised
OL,19,Fquestions around the culture on campus
OL,20,Fof drug and alcohol use, and the way
OL,21,Finvestigations were conducted in the
OL,22,Fcase, Kotlikoff said.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
